{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0144NdLAGMC5QkJ1zE5jbryj","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_1/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# struct_self_consist_ie — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-16 09:25 UTC | 更新原因: D113 Table 2 critical bug — reprioritized: fix before new experiments\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nStructured IE 的 confidence signal 能预测质量（AUROC 0.82, ρ 0.45）但无法改善 greedy decoding。两个失败机制（instance degeneracy + LP compression）+ capability trap 统一解释。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 目标\\\\n**EMNLP 2026 Main Conference** via ARR May 2026, DDL 2026-05-25（9 天）\\\\n\\\\n## ⚠️ D113 Critical: Table 2 micro/macro F1 混用\\\\n- Greedy 行用 micro F1 (0.663, 551 inst)，其他行用 macro F1 (529 inst)\\\\n- 公平比较: Greedy macro=0.645 ≈ LP=0.647, Selection 只能恢复 T=1.0 degradation\\\\n- \\\\\\\"Single\\\\\\\" 行标注错误（实际是 T=0 greedy）\\\\n- Agent 紧急修复中，P0 优先于所有新实验\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research → Review 迭代（Round 15, 3.0/5）\\\\n- **Core Claims**: 三层论证 + capability trap (D112), micro/macro 修正 (D113)\\\\n- **数据集**: SciERC ✅ | CoNLL ✅ | WNUT ✅ | Few-NERD 🔄\\\\n- **模型**: Qwen3-8B ✅ | Qwen3-4B ✅ | LLaMA-3.1-8B ✅\\\\n- **Dream**: dream_20260516T092241 running (full mode)\\\\n\\\\n## 优先级（D113 修正版）\\\\n| 优先级 | 任务 | 时间 | GPU | 状态 |\\\\n|--------|------|------|-----|------|\\\\n| P0 | Table 2 统一 macro F1 + 叙事重构 | 4-8h | 0 | 🔄 Agent 紧急处理 |\\\\n| P1 | 3rd seed SciERC (exp-022) | 2-4h | 1 | ⏳ |\\\\n| P2 | Hybrid strategy (degenerate→greedy, non-degen→MBR) | 1-2h | 0 | ⏳ |\\\\n| P3 | LoRA rank=8 ablation (exp-023) | 4-6h | 1 | ⏳ |\\\\n| P4 | Few-NERD (exp-020/021) | 4-16h | 1 | ⏳ 数据准备 |\\\\n| P0 | Claim audit (exp-024) | CPU | 0 | 与 Table 2 修复合并 |\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 计划（2 GPUs）\\\\n- GPU 1: 3rd seed (3h) → LoRA rank=8 train (5h) → LoRA inference (2h)\\\\n- GPU 2: Few-NERD train (4-16h) → inference (2-3h)\\\\n- CPU 并行: Table 2 修复 + Hybrid 分析 + Claim audit\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] Agent 完成 Table 2 macro F1 重算 + bootstrap (D113 P0)\\\\n- [ ] Paper Agent 修复 Abstract/Intro/Discussion/C3 叙事\\\\n- [ ] 3rd seed SciERC 推理 (exp-022)\\\\n- [ ] Hybrid strategy 分析\\\\n- [ ] LoRA rank=8 ablation (exp-023)\\\\n- [ ] Few-NERD smoke test → full (exp-020/021)\\\\n- [ ] Dream 完成后处理反馈\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D116 | 2026-05-16 | D116: Dream full review 分析 — Best/Worst 3.0, Media | exp_023_lora_rank8, exp_fewnerd_smoke |\\\\n| D115 | 2026-05-16 | D115: Few-NERD INTRA split 错误 — 暂停 exp-020，改用 supe | exp_fewnerd_smoke |\\\\n| D114 | 2026-05-16 | D114: Reviewer critical — D113 P0 修复停滞 + GPU 空转。紧急 | exp_3rd_seed_scierc, exp_fewnerd_smoke, exp_lora_rank8_ablation |\\\\n| D113 | 2026-05-16 | D113: Table 2 micro/macro F1 混用 critical bug — 修复优 | exp_016_rerun_1024, exp_016_rerun_1024_bootstrap |\\\\n| D112 | 2026-05-16 | D112: Main Conference 实验策略锁定 — Few-NERD + 3rd seed | d108_lp_vc_combination |\\\\n| D111 | 2026-05-16 | D110 修正: MF3 从 \\\\\\\"fine-tuning artifact\\\\\\\" 转为 \\\\\\\"capabili | d108_lp_vc_combination, d108_mbr_within_instance_rho |\\\\n| D110 | 2026-05-16 | Round 14→15: 三层结构重组 + fine-tuning artifact 差异化 + M | d108_mbr_within_instance_rho, d108_greedy_f1, d108_lp_vc_combination |\\\\n| D109 | 2026-05-16 | D109: 论文核心 claim \\\\\\\"within-instance utility 不相关\\\\\\\" 被 Q | exp_012_rerun_1024, exp_002_conll_n16_r1024 |\\\\n| D108 | 2026-05-16 | D108: Round 13 Action Matrix — T=0 greedy baseline | exp_012_rerun_1024, exp_002_conll_n16_r1024 |\\\\n| D107 | 2026-05-16 | Entity-token LP 实验完成(negative): 格式 token 稀释存在但非 LP | exp_entity_token_lp |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3107, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_011DjSNshruw26GgPcjQBwpW","session_id":"352b5339-5de3-432c-8453-cee5bd2f497d","uuid":"48ce0ac1-5899-4ad6-afb9-a5fdd8230697","timestamp":"20